# ⚠ BOTH SPELLINGS, AND THE SECOND ONE IS NOT REDUNDANT (2026-09-01, F-416).
# A trailing slash matches DIRECTORIES ONLY, so a `node_modules` SYMLINK is a
# file to git and slips past it — which is exactly how a self-referential
# `node_modules -> node_modules` link was committed here as a mode-120000 blob.
# It then shadowed every real install on checkout, and `npm test` in this tree
# died with "Cannot find module 'electron-store'" for 72 cases.
node_modules/
node_modules
dist/
.DS_Store
*.dmg

# Vite build output for the bundled SPA (apps/desktop-ui → `npm run build:ui`).
# Build artifact, never edited by hand; electron-builder picks it up from the
# working tree via `files: ["renderer/**/*"]`, so it must EXIST before a
# packaging run. See WIRING.md.
renderer/app/
